secrets-veil is vendored unchanged from https://github.com/yonatangross/orchestkit/tree/0fe5beba22aac523980db5b769242a32c3663a05/mods/secrets-veil (mod version 0.0.6; read 2026-10-17). All shipped files are byte-identical to that commit except hooks/register.ts, tests/register.test.ts and README.md: the empty-named-list $.ui.notice at session start is removed, because a notice there has no open tool call and the engine dropped it with an error line in every session. hooks/register.ts also masks a media field (a base64 or data key holding the base64 of an image or PDF, checked by its decoded file signature) with the named values only: the entropy pattern and a chance shape prefix covered such base64, and the API refused every image a session read. This NOTICE and VENDOR.json are added.

